<p>You establish a powerful mental link with your Worm that Walks.</p><p>As long as you remain within radius 3 of your worm that walks each of you gains <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 18%, 20%, 23%, 25%</acronym> all resistance for 5 turns.</p><p>Additionally, your Worm that Walks permanently gains an inscription slot every 2 raw talent levels (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym>).</p>